# FIN-011: Q2 2023 Quarterly Report

**MedSync Health**
**Reporting Period:** April 1, 2023 – June 30, 2023
**Date of Issue:** July 20, 2023
**Currency:** United Arab Emirates Dirham (AED)

---

## 1. Executive Summary

MedSync Health delivered a strong performance in the second quarter of 2023, continuing the robust growth trajectory established in the first quarter. Total revenue for Q2 2023 reached **AED 88,200,000**, representing a significant 50.0% increase year-over-year (YoY) compared to Q2 2022 (AED 58,800,000) and a 9.09% sequential increase quarter-over-quarter (QoQ) from Q1 2023 (AED 80,850,000).

This growth was primarily driven by the continued adoption of our core product, MedSync Connect, and the expanding market penetration of MedSync Analytics. The company also continued its strategic investment in human capital, increasing the total headcount to 950 employees by the end of the quarter.

